      "subject": "Information needed for your quote: 3567 Lakeview Blvd",
      "body": "Thank you for your submission. To complete the quote we need the items below. One reply covering all of them is ideal.\n\nLocation\n1. Please provide: State\n\nInsured\n2. Please provide: Insured First Name\n3. Is the property owned by a trust?\n\nPrimary Coverages\n4. Please provide: Coverage E (Liability) (one of: 100000, 300000, 500000)\n\nProperty\n5. Please provide: Consecutive Months Unoccupied\n6. Please provide: Pool Type (one of: None, Above Ground, Inground)\n7. If there is a pool, please provide: Pool Security (one of: None, Unfenced, Fenced)\n8. If the pool is above ground, please provide: Above-ground pool has pull-up locking ladder\n\nConstruction\n9. Please provide: Total Living Square Footage\n10. Please provide: Number of Stories\n11. Please provide: Roof Surface Material (one of: Architecture Shingles, Asphalt Fiberglass Composite, Clay Tile, Concrete Tile, Metal Shingles / Sheets, Slate, Standing Seam Metal, Wood Shake, Wood Shingle, Other)\n12. Please provide: Electrical Panel Size (amps)\n\nPlumbing\n13. Please provide: Water Heater Type (one of: Tank, Tankless)\n\nProtection\n14. Please provide: Miles to Fire Department\n15. Please provide: Fire Department Type / Staffing (one of: Career, Mostly Career, Mostly Volunteer, Volunteer, Unknown)\n16. Please provide: Distance to Nearest Fire Hydrant (Feet)\n\nAdditional questions\n17. The application lists 0 people living in an owner-occupied home. Please confirm the number of people who live in the home.",
